  "body": "Afternoons spent swimming, a friendly game of tennis or evenings entertaining in beautiful gardens. This exceptional Takapuna estate brings together the pleasures of a private retreat and the convenience of a prestigious Golden Mile address.\r\n\r\nWith 1,892sqm of land (more or less) across two separate titles, the property offers remarkable space in this tightly held coastal neighbourhood. The generous grounds provide room for recreation and relaxation, while the two titles add flexibility for the future.\r\n\r\nBeyond high walls and ornate electric gates, formal gardens, neatly shaped box hedges and sculpted topiary create a welcoming arrival. Carefully renovated throughout, the approx. 410sqm residence pairs classic architectural character with the comfort and finish of modern living.\r\n\r\nSpacious living areas offer settings for quiet family time and larger celebrations, opening to outdoor entertaining spaces that make the most of the garden surroundings. Whether hosting friends or enjoying a peaceful weekend at home, there is room to spread out and unwind.\r\n\r\nFour generous bedrooms and three beautifully appointed bathrooms accommodate family and guests. Upstairs provides a peaceful retreat, with the private master suite enjoying tranquil lake views.\r\n\r\nThe grounds complete the experience, with space for tennis, swimming and putting practice, all within a secluded setting. It is an appealing combination of an elegant home, extensive gardens and recreation at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented and substantial in scale, this Golden Mile estate offers a special place to settle in and enjoy for years to come.",
